<title>USA: Telecom ADRS rise 1-1/2 in New York.</title>
<headline>Telecom ADRS rise 1-1/2 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand rose 1-1/2 to 74-3/8 after it bought back 760,000 shares on Tuesday. The company bought back 939,000 shares on Monday.</p>
<p>Volume at midday was 1.7 million shares, about 20 times normal daily trade. Telecom Corp was the most active ADR.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
